{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1372262-what\u2019s-the-difference-between-solving-a-mystery-and-using-magic","id":1372262,"title":"What\u2019s the difference between solving a Mystery and using magic?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-03-02T06:35:19-08:00","id":1372262,"title":"What\u2019s the difference between solving a Mystery and using magic?","content":"The presence of an active hallow could be a mystery (opacity 1) but that can be discovered with magic (prime). <br /> <br /> So what is the difference between mage sight or unveiling practice? <br /> Why a mage would use the mage sight if he can use magic?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12677-alamantra","name":"Alamantra","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-02T09:07:34-08:00","id":1372290,"title":"","content":"Mage sight gives a deeper understanding of something, sure prime will show you that the hollow is magical but mage sight will show you why and how.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-02T13:37:12-08:00","id":1372326,"title":"","content":"Knowing/Unveiling spells and Focused Mage Sight can often give you very overlapping information when used on simple objects or phenomena, but that's because Focused Mage Sight isn't for gaining basic information like that. Focused Mage Sight is what you use to solve the weird Mysteries that are worth Obsessing over, granting you information that spells often fails to reveal.<br /> <br /> Your example of an active Hallow is not a weird Mystery, so you're better off using Prime Knowing/Unveiling instead. Now say that the Hallow is active despite being over-saturated with tass and not intersecting with any ley lines, and you've got yourself a minor Mystery that you might not be able to solve using only spells because you don't know what spells to cast or what to cast the spells on other than the Hallow, etc. That's when Focused Mage Sight comes in.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-02T16:28:12-08:00","id":1372348,"title":"","content":"In a word, actualization.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-03T13:47:45-08:00","id":1372529,"title":"","content":"Jabme arrives at the scene of the attack, she casts an Unveiling of Death to find weapons. She locates a green khopesh.<br /> <br /> She casts a Knowing of Death and Matter to get forensic data. Its made of bronze oxidized by brine, with traces of honey, candle wax and black silt found on the blade. It was sharpened on bones and used to kill 6 victims by slashing their throats.<br /> <br /> She uses Focused Mage Sight on it and sees a man cloaked in shadows, walking up, unimpeded, against the raging flow of a river.<br /> <br /> At the river's source there is an entrance to a floating stage hall, with 6 people dressed like Egyptians and posed like statues. They stand perfectly still as he recites one phrase, kills one, recites another line and keeps doing it until they are all dead:<br /> <br /> &quot;Upon fifty fathoms,<br /> frozen in briny past,<br /> rip from the name loom,<br /> sunder the lifeweave,<br /> lock tight in earthgrip,<br /> hold firm from the river' pass&quot;<br /> <br /> The shadow is shocked as the sacrifices stand up, grow two more arms and set to pursue him. Her vision fades and she sees no more.<br /> <br /> <b>Answer to the Mystery:</b> A mortal occultist conducted a ritual killing of 6 people aboard a cruise off the coast. He hoped to make them into ushabti servants, but botched it up so spectacularly that they returned as Geist seeking their due.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 03-03-2020, 10:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-10T08:03:01-07:00","id":1373927,"title":"","content":"Spells are good at answering questions.<br /> Mage sight is good at helping you figure out what questions to ask.<br /> <br /> A spirit spell will let you know what type of spirit cursed a building.<br /> Mage sight helps you narrow it down to spirits in the first place instead of worrying about mages, destinies, or the building being a vampire's hunting ground.<br /> <br /> <br /> That's all surface mage sight. Deep mystery investigation also gets helped similar to the six murder ritual mentioned above. <br /> <br /> Basically, magesight uses a broad spectrum of information gathering available under a given Arcana's purview and then the mage sifts and filters through the info. Spells are much more narrow and thus faster and easier.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3642-lareath","name":"Lareath","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"186"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-19T21:18:08-07:00","id":1390185,"title":"","content":"Mage sight is categorical. It emphasizes or reveals what fits within it. Active mage sight doesn't go much farther then that. Spells are highly specialized. They are custom made for the current events. Focused mage sight finishes the job once you cornered the Mystery.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26112-excess","name":"Excess","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"271"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}